{"seq":2,"slug":"dynamic-weight-failover","title":"动态权重、灰度与故障转移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/acquiring-smart-routing-auth/psp-acquirer-routing/dynamic-weight-failover","wordCount":3525,"readingTime":15,"html":"<h1 id=\"动态权重-灰度与故障转移\">动态权重、灰度与故障转移</h1><p>确定了因子和打分函数之后，剩下的问题是：权重是一张静态配置，还是随时间和环境变化的活参数？答案取决于你对「通道会劣化」这件事的容忍度。通道一定会在某个时刻劣化——收单行的风控模型上线、银行侧的 BIN 段调整、区域性网络抖动、通道被限流——静态权重在这些时刻会让平台跟着一起劣化，而且劣化的速度由人工发现问题的速度决定。动态权重把「发现劣化」和「降低流量」压缩到秒级。</p>\n<p>但动态化是有代价的。权重一旦自动变化，可解释性下降，出问题时更难复盘；同时自动降权如果抖动太大，会造成流量在通道间来回震荡（flapping），反而把两个通道都拖坏。这一篇讲的是如何在「反应足够快」和「不震荡」之间找到工程上可用的平衡点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-动态化的是流量分配-不是策略意图\">核心概念：动态化的是流量分配，不是策略意图</h2><p>需要先把动态权重的目标说清楚，否则很容易做过头。动态化要改变的是「流量在健康通道之间怎么分布」，不是「平台愿意承担多少风险」。风险的承担是策略层的事——哪些 MCC 接、哪些地区接、容忍多少欺诈——这部分必须保持静态、可审计、人工可控。一个自动降权机制如果连高风险商户的流量也能自动导流到风控更松的通道，那它就从优化工具变成了风险放大器。</p>\n<p>因此动态权重的作用范围被限制在两层之内：一是在<strong>已经合法且合规的候选集合</strong>内重新分配权重（约束过滤的结果不可被自动机制推翻），二是在<strong>同一风险等级的通道组</strong>内调整（不允许跨组自动迁移）。前者由上一节的合规约束保证，后者需要给每个通道打上风险等级标签，自动权重只在标签相同的通道之间生效。</p>\n<p>在这个边界内，动态权重的机制是清晰的：健康度信号 → 熔断状态机 → 权重惩罚 → 灰度与回滚。下面依次展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"健康度-从原始信号到可比较的分数\">健康度：从原始信号到可比较的分数</h2><p>动态权重的输入是通道健康度。健康度不是单一指标，而是几类信号的组合，且必须对「技术性失败」和「业务性拒绝」区别对待。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>是否算「通道坏了」</th>\n<th>建议灵敏度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>连接超时 / DNS 失败</td>\n<td>请求未到达通道</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高（秒级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP 5xx / 熔断触发</td>\n<td>通道自身故障</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺失响应（无回包）</td>\n<td>结果未知</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通道级业务拒绝率突升</td>\n<td>通道侧风控变化</td>\n<td>视情况</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BIN 段拒绝率突升</td>\n<td>特定卡段问题</td>\n<td>否（应走分层路由）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整体拒绝率上升</td>\n<td>可能是流量结构变化</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表最关键的一行是「结果未知」。超时和缺少回包在支付场景里极其危险：交易可能已经在发卡行被批准，只是回包丢了。把它当作「失败」并降权通常是安全的（因为重试有幂等保护），但绝不能当作「拒绝」写进批准率的分母——否则会污染统计。这一点在第 4 章的指标定义里会再次强调。</p>\n<p>健康度用一个 0 到 1 的分数表示，由多个信号加权得到。对技术性信号用高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 的 EWMA 快速反应，对业务性信号用低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 的 EWMA 平滑掉噪声：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>tech</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>EWMA</mtext><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>tech_ok</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>biz</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>EWMA</mtext><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>biz_ok</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_c = w_{\\text{tech}} \\cdot \\text{EWMA}_{\\alpha_t}(\\text{tech\\_ok}) + w_{\\text{biz}} \\cdot \\text{EWMA}_{\\alpha_b}(\\text{biz\\_ok})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tech</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EWMA</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tech_ok</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">biz</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EWMA</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2559em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">biz_ok</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>≫</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_t \\gg \\alpha_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。经验上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取 0.2–0.4（约几十秒到几分钟的有效窗口），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取 0.02–0.05（认知以小时计）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么要用-ewma-而不是固定窗口\">为什么要用 EWMA 而不是固定窗口</h3><p>固定时间窗口（例如「最近 5 分钟的失败率」）在窗口边界会产生跳变，也是流量震荡的常见来源。EWMA 是连续的、无边界记忆的，且只需要保存一个标量状态，非常适合高频更新。缺陷是对极端的瞬时故障反应不够快——一次持续 3 秒的通道全挂，在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span></span></span></span></span> 下需要几十秒才能把健康度压下来。解决办法不是调大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>（会让整体抖动），而是在 EWMA 之上叠加一个硬熔断：任何连续 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 次技术失败或失败率在一分钟窗口内超过阈值，直接进入 OPEN 状态，跳过 EWMA 的平滑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"熔断状态机\">熔断状态机</h2><p>熔断器是健康度的快速通道。它的状态机设计要满足两点：故障时快速切断，恢复时缓慢试探（避免刚恢复就涌入全部流量把通道再次打挂）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; CLOSED&#10;  CLOSED --&gt; OPEN: 连续失败N次 或 一分钟失败率&gt;阈值&#10;  OPEN --&gt; HALF_OPEN: 冷却期结束&#10;  HALF_OPEN --&gt; CLOSED: 试探流量全部成功&#10;  HALF_OPEN --&gt; OPEN: 试探流量出现失败\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; CLOSED\n  CLOSED --&gt; OPEN: 连续失败N次 或 一分钟失败率&gt;阈值\n  OPEN --&gt; HALF_OPEN: 冷却期结束\n  HALF_OPEN --&gt; CLOSED: 试探流量全部成功\n  HALF_OPEN --&gt; OPEN: 试探流量出现失败</pre><p>状态机的参数是三个数：失败阈值、冷却期长度、半开试探流量大小。跨境收单的经验值是冷却期不能太短（通道侧重启通常需要 30–120 秒），试探流量要小（1–5 笔或按 QPS 的 1%）且必须隔离标记，这样即使试探失败也不会影响真实交易——试探流量应当走与真实交易相同的通道但标记为 probe，其失败只影响熔断判断，不影响商户的授权结果。</p>\n<p>半开状态的判定标准要严格。常见错误是「试探成功 1 笔就恢复 CLOSED」，这会让一个间歇性故障的通道在 OPEN/HALF_OPEN 之间反复横跳。更稳的做法是要求连续的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 笔试探全部成功（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 取 3–5），并且要求试探覆盖到不同的发卡行 BIN 段——如果只用一笔本地借记卡试探成功就放行全部流量，跨境商业卡可能立刻再次失败。</p>\n<p>下面是熔断器的一个最小可用实现形态（伪代码，描述状态与转移条件）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"state = { status: CLOSED, consecutive_fail: 0, opened_at: null, probe_ok: 0 }&#10;&#10;on_result(ok, is_technical):&#10;  if status == OPEN:&#10;    return  # 真实流量不应到达 OPEN 通道&#10;  if status == HALF_OPEN:&#10;    if ok: probe_ok += 1; if probe_ok &gt;= K: enter_closed()&#10;    else:  enter_open()            # 试探失败立即回 OPEN，冷却期重新计&#10;    return&#10;  # CLOSED&#10;  if is_technical:&#10;    consecutive_fail += 1&#10;    if consecutive_fail &gt;= N: enter_open()&#10;  else:&#10;    consecutive_fail = 0&#10;&#10;enter_open():   status = OPEN;  opened_at = now&#10;enter_closed(): status = CLOSED; consecutive_fail = 0; probe_ok = 0&#10;# 后台定时器: if status == OPEN and now - opened_at &gt; COOLDOWN: status = HALF_OPEN\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>state = { status: CLOSED, consecutive_fail: 0, opened_at: null, probe_ok: 0 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>on_result(ok, is_technical):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if status == OPEN:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return  # 真实流量不应到达 OPEN 通道</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if status == HALF_OPEN:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if ok: probe_ok += 1; if probe_ok >= K: enter_closed()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else:  enter_open()            # 试探失败立即回 OPEN，冷却期重新计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # CLOSED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if is_technical:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    consecutive_fail += 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if consecutive_fail >= N: enter_open()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  else:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    consecutive_fail = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enter_open():   status = OPEN;  opened_at = now</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enter_closed(): status = CLOSED; consecutive_fail = 0; probe_ok = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 后台定时器: if status == OPEN and now - opened_at > COOLDOWN: status = HALF_OPEN</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"权重如何随健康度变化\">权重如何随健康度变化</h2><p>有了健康度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，权重的动态调整有三种粒度的做法，选择取决于你希望多快反应以及能否承受震荡。</p>\n<h3 id=\"硬剔除优先于连续降权\">硬剔除优先于连续降权</h3><p>第一优先级是把健康度嵌入 <code>guards.remove_when</code>（见 <a href=\"routing-decision-factors\">路由决策因子</a> 的配置结构），即健康度低于阈值时直接剔除候选，而不是让健康度进入加权和。原因是加权和会被其他因子补偿：一个健康度只有 0.4 的通道，如果它的批准率估计是 0.97、费率又最低，加权和仍可能胜出，而它的健康度低说明这个批准率估计本身已经不可信。硬剔除是安全网。</p>\n<h3 id=\"连续降权的形式\">连续降权的形式</h3><p>不是所有劣化都值得硬剔除（例如健康度从 0.95 降到 0.85，通道仍可用但不如以前）。这种情况下用乘性惩罚而不是加性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>H</mi><mi>γ</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S&#x27;(c) = S(c) \\cdot g(H_c), \\qquad g(H) = H^{\\gamma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 控制惩罚的陡峭程度。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时健康度线性缩放分数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 时只有健康度很高的通道才能保持接近原分数。乘性惩罚的好处是它对所有因子一视同仁——健康度差的通道不会因为费率便宜而被救回来。实践中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 取 2 左右，并让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(H)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 低于某值时归零（与硬剔除衔接）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"权重的上下限与变化速率限制\">权重的上下限与变化速率限制</h3><p>自动权重必须有边界，否则一次统计污染就能造成灾难。三条约束是必备的：单通道权重占比上限（防止全流量灌入一个通道）、权重的最大变化速率（例如每分钟最多变化 10%，防止震荡）、以及最小流量保底（每个健康通道至少保留 1–5% 流量，用以持续获取该通道的表现数据——没有流量就没有数据，没有数据就无法判断它是否已经恢复）。最后一条是探索与利用的经典权衡，也是很多「自动路由」系统的隐性 bug 来源：一旦某通道权重降到 0，它就再也拿不到样本，永远无法被证明已恢复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"灰度发布-让新策略可控地生效\">灰度发布：让新策略可控地生效</h2><p>动态权重解决「已知通道劣化」，灰度解决「未知策略风险」。任何路由策略改动（新因子、新权重、新过滤规则）在上线前都必须经过灰度，而路由灰度的难点在于：它天然不是一个可以随便切分流量的对象。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分流维度的选择\">分流维度的选择</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分流维度</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按商户 ID 哈希</td>\n<td>同一商户体验一致，易于沟通</td>\n<td>商户间差异大，样本可能偏</td>\n<td>商户级策略改动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按交易 ID 哈希</td>\n<td>分流均匀，样本随机性好</td>\n<td>同一用户可能走不同策略</td>\n<td>纯算法类改动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按 BIN 段</td>\n<td>能针对性验证某卡段</td>\n<td>覆盖面窄，需多轮</td>\n<td>BIN 相关的匹配度改动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按地区/币种</td>\n<td>与本地收单策略自然对齐</td>\n<td>地区间差异大</td>\n<td>区域性通道调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按时间窗口（影子）</td>\n<td>零风险</td>\n<td>只能观察不能测量结果</td>\n<td>上线前验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>按交易 ID 哈希是算法类改动最常用的方式，但它有一个隐藏问题：同一用户在短时间内连续两笔交易（同一个会话的重复尝试）可能落到不同策略上，导致用户体验不一致，也可能让「用户级」的指标失真。因此在按交易分流时，通常会加一个会话级粘性——同一会话内的多次尝试走同一策略分支。</p>\n<h3 id=\"灰度阶梯与自动回滚\">灰度阶梯与自动回滚</h3><p>灰度不是「1% 直接到 100%」，而是阶梯：1% → 5% → 20% → 50% → 100%，每一级必须观察足够样本才能升级。路由实验的门槛是「每个分支至少有几千笔交易，且覆盖主要 BIN 段」，因为批准率的差异通常是几个基点量级，样本少了根本测不出统计显著。</p>\n<p>自动回滚条件是灰度的核心安全机制，必须在灰度开始前就定义好，而不是事后判断。可用的回滚触发条件包括：新策略分支的批准率比对照组低超过阈值（例如低 1 个百分点且显著）、新策略导致的平均延迟上升超过 X 毫秒、技术失败率上升、以及单通道流量集中度超过上限。回滚必须是<strong>自动的且秒级生效</strong>——依赖人工发现时，一个坏策略可以在几分钟内造成大量失败交易。</p>\n<p>一个可行的灰度配置形态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;experiment&quot;: &quot;routing-v2-bin-match&quot;,&#10;  &quot;ramp&quot;: [0.01, 0.05, 0.2, 0.5, 1.0],&#10;  &quot;unit&quot;: &quot;session_id&quot;,&#10;  &quot;min_samples_per_step&quot;: 3000,&#10;  &quot;guards&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;rollback_if&quot;: [&#10;      { &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;approval_rate&quot;, &quot;delta_pp&quot;: -1.0, &quot;significant&quot;: true },&#10;      { &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;p99_latency_ms&quot;, &quot;delta&quot;: 150 },&#10;      { &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;tech_fail_rate&quot;, &quot;delta_pp&quot;: 0.5 },&#10;      { &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;max_channel_share&quot;, &quot;gte&quot;: 0.75 }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;observation_window&quot;: &quot;2h&quot;,&#10;    &quot;freeze_on_hard_stop&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"experiment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"routing-v2-bin-match\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ramp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"unit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"session_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"min_samples_per_step\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"guards\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"rollback_if\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"approval_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"delta_pp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"significant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p99_latency_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"delta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">150</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tech_fail_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"delta_pp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"max_channel_share\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"gte\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.75</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"observation_window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2h\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"freeze_on_hard_stop\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>unit: session_id</code> 表示按会话分流（保证会话内一致），<code>freeze_on_hard_stop</code> 表示一旦触发回滚就冻结该实验、不允许自动重新升级——防止「回滚后立刻又升回坏分支」的循环。这个配置的验证逻辑与第 4 章的实验设计是同一套统计基础，只是这里的门槛更保守。</p>\n<h2 id=\"故障转移-从一个通道切到另一个\">故障转移：从一个通道切到另一个</h2><p>故障转移（failover）是动态权重的极端形式：不是降权，而是完全不再尝试该通道。它发生在两个层面。</p>\n<p>第一层是<strong>通道级熔断</strong>，即上文的状态机。通道进入 OPEN 后，路由的候选集合不再包含它，流量自然转移到次选通道。这一层的触发条件是通道自身不可用。</p>\n<p>第二层是<strong>交易级 fallback</strong>，即某笔具体交易的首次尝试被软拒绝后，是否换通道重试。这一层的决策逻辑完全不同：它不是「通道坏了」，而是「这笔交易在这个通道上没通过」。它的关键在于拒绝码的分类——哪些码换通道有意义、哪些码换了也白搭甚至有害。这套分类属于 decline salvage 的范畴，详见 <a href=\"../authentication-optimization/decline-salvage-retry\">Decline salvage 智能重试</a>。</p>\n<p>两层之间需要防止一个反模式：故障转移不能形成级联。如果通道 A 挂了把所有流量推给 B，B 因为突然过载也挂了，再推给 C——这就是雪崩。防止手段是转移前检查目标通道的容量水位（<code>capacity_water</code>，见 <a href=\"routing-decision-factors\">路由决策因子</a>），并对转移流量做限速：转移不是「把 A 的流量原样搬到 B」，而是「按 B 的剩余容量搬」。当所有通道的水位都不足时，正确的行为是快速失败并让上游限流，而不是把每个通道依次打挂。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>健康度必须区分技术性失败与业务性拒绝；「结果未知」按失败处理但不能进拒绝率分母。</li>\n<li>熔断器是 EWMA 之上的快速通道，参数是失败阈值、冷却期、试探流量；半开恢复要连续多笔且覆盖多 BIN 段。</li>\n<li>权重动态调整的顺序是：硬剔除 → 乘性惩罚 → 连续降权；自动权重必须有占比上限、变化速率限制、最小流量保底。</li>\n<li>最小流量保底是防止「通道因权重归零而永远拿不到样本」这一隐性 bug 的必要设计。</li>\n<li>灰度要按合适维度分流（会话级粘性）、阶梯升级、样本充足，且回滚条件必须预先定义并自动执行。</li>\n<li>故障转移分通道级与交易级两层，转移必须受目标通道容量约束，否则会形成级联雪崩。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本文引用但未展开的内容：约束类过滤规则见 <a href=\"merchant-mcc-region-constraint\">商户/MCC/地区合规约束</a>；软拒绝的分类与换通道重试的决策见 <a href=\"../authentication-optimization/decline-salvage-retry\">Decline salvage 智能重试</a>；灰度的统计检验与净收益评估见 <a href=\"../auth-analytics-ops/routing-ab-test\">路由策略 A/B 实验</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"动态权重、灰度与故障转移","id":"动态权重-灰度与故障转移"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：动态化的是流量分配，不是策略意图","id":"核心概念-动态化的是流量分配-不是策略意图"},{"level":2,"text":"健康度：从原始信号到可比较的分数","id":"健康度-从原始信号到可比较的分数"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么要用 EWMA 而不是固定窗口","id":"为什么要用-ewma-而不是固定窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"熔断状态机","id":"熔断状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"权重如何随健康度变化","id":"权重如何随健康度变化"},{"level":3,"text":"硬剔除优先于连续降权","id":"硬剔除优先于连续降权"},{"level":3,"text":"连续降权的形式","id":"连续降权的形式"},{"level":3,"text":"权重的上下限与变化速率限制","id":"权重的上下限与变化速率限制"},{"level":2,"text":"灰度发布：让新策略可控地生效","id":"灰度发布-让新策略可控地生效"},{"level":3,"text":"分流维度的选择","id":"分流维度的选择"},{"level":3,"text":"灰度阶梯与自动回滚","id":"灰度阶梯与自动回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"故障转移：从一个通道切到另一个","id":"故障转移-从一个通道切到另一个"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"路由决策因子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/acquiring-smart-routing-auth/psp-acquirer-routing/routing-decision-factors"},"next":{"title":"商户/MCC/地区合规约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/acquiring-smart-routing-auth/psp-acquirer-routing/merchant-mcc-region-constraint"}}